{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0169CkrTkn1iSPigjKpYpko5","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Median vs mean — Mira O.\n2\t\n3\tThe mean gets dragged around by outliers; the median doesn't. If a class of ten students has salaries at graduation of $45k, $48k, $50k, $52k, $54k, $55k, $58k, $60k, $62k, and one lands at $400k, the mean jumps to $88.4k. The median barely moves — from $54.5k to $54.5k. A number that describes almost nobody in the room is a worse summary than a number that describes the middle person, which is the point. So report the median when a single big value is doing all the pulling.\n4\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"65af77fa-b16d-418d-9c40-2d9bc98bf000","uuid":"f52f878e-5f29-4dd8-ab0f-fbd214932560","timestamp":"2026-09-10T08:20:25.844Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/bear/Documents/CoWork/bear-textbooks/books/anthropics/claude-code-101/03-hooks-skills-commands/cc-grading-skill-definition/scratch/submissions/mira.md","content":"# Median vs mean — Mira O.\n\nThe mean gets dragged around by outliers; the median doesn't. If a class of ten students has salaries at graduation of $45k, $48k, $50k, $52k, $54k, $55k, $58k, $60k, $62k, and one lands at $400k, the mean jumps to $88.4k. The median barely moves — from $54.5k to $54.5k. A number that describes almost nobody in the room is a worse summary than a number that describes the middle person, which is the point. So report the median when a single big value is doing all the pulling.\n","numLines":4,"startLine":1,"totalLines":4}}}
